# 📋 Environment Variables — muse-skills
#
# This repository is a curated agent-skill suite with no runtime services:
# it currently requires NO environment variables to install, test, or use.
#
# If a future skill or script introduces a required variable, declare it
# here with a non-sensitive placeholder (never a real key) and note which
# script consumes it.

# ── Local development (optional) ──────────────────────────────
# NODE_ENV=development
